{"4294030":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Tavernia","steam_appid":4294030,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"dlc":[5198350],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavernia is a multiplayer party game of trivia, duels and conquest for 2 to 8 players.<\/strong> Pull up a chair, claim tiles on a hand-painted map, and defend your kingdom by beating your friends at whatever the cards throw at you: trivia, word races, drawing, rhythm, reflexes and more. The last castle standing, or the richest ruler when the rounds run out, wins the tavern.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/004ff595d967d7d3788bead7c6f51860.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your turn, pick a tile on the board. Free land is won with a trivia question; land that belongs to a rival means a duel. Every tile you hold earns points, borders matter, and losing your castle knocks you out of the game.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Thousands of questions across dozens of topics, in English, Czech and German<br><\/li><li>Pick your topic from a hand of offers, or re-roll for a better one<br><\/li><li>Stuck on a hard one? Use 50\/50 or Ask the Tavern<\/li><\/ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/3080335b61e6df8906661d3d917658c9.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacking a rival plays a minigame card from your hand. Build a deck of your five favourites, ban the one you hate, and drag your opponent onto your home turf.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Wordlock<\/strong>: crack the hidden word before your rival<br><\/li><li><strong>Typewriter<\/strong>: out-type your opponent, word by word<br><\/li><li><strong>Tavern Drums<\/strong>: keep the beat with a tavern band<br><\/li><li><strong>Perfect Circle<\/strong>: draw a rounder circle by hand, no guides<br><\/li><li><strong>Cartographer<\/strong>: pin cities on a world map<br><\/li><li><strong>Catacombs<\/strong>: find your way out of the maze first<br><\/li><li><strong>Lockpick<\/strong>, <strong>Numeris<\/strong>, <strong>Masterwork<\/strong>, <strong>Mirrorbound<\/strong>, <strong>Detective<\/strong>, <strong>Word Chain<\/strong>, <strong>Letter Soup<\/strong>, <strong>Arcane Reveal<\/strong>, <strong>Phantom Phrases<\/strong>, <strong>Hands of Fate<\/strong>, <strong>Flashpoint<\/strong>, <strong>Wisdom's Path<\/strong> and more<\/li><\/ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/5d987866d830374cf3f9dc1ace2a7bf8.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up to 8 players per room; invite Steam friends straight from the lobby<br><\/li><li>Public rooms, private rooms and Quick Match<br><\/li><li>Spectate any game and watch every keystroke, pencil stroke and drumbeat live<br><\/li><li><strong>Streamers<\/strong>: connect Twitch or Kick and your chat joins in, bets on duels and earns beers (XP) for their own accounts<\/li><\/ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/e9af2faab3fa88b1f42598b217a04d1e.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Level up, unlock achievements and climb the leaderboards<br><\/li><li>Upgrade your cards from common to legendary by winning duels with them<br><\/li><li>Earn profile frames and dress your hand in new skins<br><\/li><li>Join a guild with your friends or community<\/li><\/ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/10fce00bfed92e2be6df7a940949c468.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2–8 player online multiplayer<br><\/li><li>18 duel minigames plus solo trivia and a shared round challenge every round<br><\/li><li>English, Czech and German, with questions written for each language<br><\/li><li>Spectator mode and Twitch\/Kick chat integration<br><\/li><li>Cross-play with players on the web version<br><\/li><li>Original medieval tavern soundtrack<\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tavernia is a multiplayer party game of trivia, duels and conquest for 2 to 8 players.<\/strong> Pull up a chair, claim tiles on a hand-painted map, and defend your kingdom by beating your friends at whatever the cards throw at you: trivia, word races, drawing, rhythm, reflexes and more. The last castle standing, or the richest ruler when the rounds run out, wins the tavern.<\/p><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/004ff595d967d7d3788bead7c6f51860.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your turn, pick a tile on the board. Free land is won with a trivia question; land that belongs to a rival means a duel. Every tile you hold earns points, borders matter, and losing your castle knocks you out of the game.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Thousands of questions across dozens of topics, in English, Czech and German<br><\/li><li>Pick your topic from a hand of offers, or re-roll for a better one<br><\/li><li>Stuck on a hard one? Use 50\/50 or Ask the Tavern<\/li><\/ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/3080335b61e6df8906661d3d917658c9.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attacking a rival plays a minigame card from your hand. Build a deck of your five favourites, ban the one you hate, and drag your opponent onto your home turf.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Wordlock<\/strong>: crack the hidden word before your rival<br><\/li><li><strong>Typewriter<\/strong>: out-type your opponent, word by word<br><\/li><li><strong>Tavern Drums<\/strong>: keep the beat with a tavern band<br><\/li><li><strong>Perfect Circle<\/strong>: draw a rounder circle by hand, no guides<br><\/li><li><strong>Cartographer<\/strong>: pin cities on a world map<br><\/li><li><strong>Catacombs<\/strong>: find your way out of the maze first<br><\/li><li><strong>Lockpick<\/strong>, <strong>Numeris<\/strong>, <strong>Masterwork<\/strong>, <strong>Mirrorbound<\/strong>, <strong>Detective<\/strong>, <strong>Word Chain<\/strong>, <strong>Letter Soup<\/strong>, <strong>Arcane Reveal<\/strong>, <strong>Phantom Phrases<\/strong>, <strong>Hands of Fate<\/strong>, <strong>Flashpoint<\/strong>, <strong>Wisdom's Path<\/strong> and more<\/li><\/ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/5d987866d830374cf3f9dc1ace2a7bf8.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Up to 8 players per room; invite Steam friends straight from the lobby<br><\/li><li>Public rooms, private rooms and Quick Match<br><\/li><li>Spectate any game and watch every keystroke, pencil stroke and drumbeat live<br><\/li><li><strong>Streamers<\/strong>: connect Twitch or Kick and your chat joins in, bets on duels and earns beers (XP) for their own accounts<\/li><\/ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/e9af2faab3fa88b1f42598b217a04d1e.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Level up, unlock achievements and climb the leaderboards<br><\/li><li>Upgrade your cards from common to legendary by winning duels with them<br><\/li><li>Earn profile frames and dress your hand in new skins<br><\/li><li>Join a guild with your friends or community<\/li><\/ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/extras\/10fce00bfed92e2be6df7a940949c468.avif?t=1792835480\" width=1232 height=200 \/><\/span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2–8 player online multiplayer<br><\/li><li>18 duel minigames plus solo trivia and a shared round challenge every round<br><\/li><li>English, Czech and German, with questions written for each language<br><\/li><li>Spectator mode and Twitch\/Kick chat integration<br><\/li><li>Cross-play with players on the web version<br><\/li><li>Original medieval tavern soundtrack<\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"A strategy board game for 2–8 players. Answer trivia to claim empty tiles, then beat your opponents in minigame duels to take theirs. Play cards to challenge them to typing races, word puzzles, reaction tests, and more.","supported_languages":"English, German, Czech","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/965172024e573a8e92d598cfd17862a9486b636e\/header.jpg?t=1792835480","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/05eefafac591fbc0a558a63d64108c3d27878654\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792835480","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/05eefafac591fbc0a558a63d64108c3d27878654\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792835480","website":"https:\/\/tavernia.io","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11 compatible integrated graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1000 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX Compatible<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 11 Big Sur or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core i5<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4096 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Metal compatible graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Network:<\/strong> Broadband Internet connection<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1000 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Standard Audio<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Hradba"],"publishers":["Hradba"],"demos":[{"appid":5198350,"description":""}],"package_groups":[],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":1,"description":"Multi-player"},{"id":49,"description":"PvP"},{"id":36,"description":"Online PvP"},{"id":27,"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer"},{"id":35,"description":"In-App Purchases"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"},{"id":"37","description":"Free To Play"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/2a018b5870ed7b8a426c0699e69e1991b07e54e6\/ss_2a018b5870ed7b8a426c0699e69e1991b07e54e6.600x338.jpg?t=1792835480","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/2a018b5870ed7b8a426c0699e69e1991b07e54e6\/ss_2a018b5870ed7b8a426c0699e69e1991b07e54e6.1920x1080.jpg?t=1792835480"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4294030\/856037a7ff5f59106be4277115ddebe402c8005e\/ss_856037a7ff5f59106be4277115ddebe402c8005e.600x338.jpg?t=1792835480","path_full":"https